   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Leader = whoever holds the etcd lock. HAProxy asks each node's Patroni API: only the leader answers yes.\nThe others stream WAL from it and are marked down for clients.",
